OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Ffading for most this evening. Turning
OL,7,Fincreasing cloudy from the west from
OL,8,Fmidnight with outbreaks of heavy and
OL,9,Fthundery rain arriving accompanied by
OL,10,Fstrengthening winds, especially along
OL,11,Fthe exposed coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FAn unsettled start with
OL,14,Fheavy, persistent rain pushing
OL,15,Feastwards. Rain turning thundery into
OL,16,Fthe afternoon with strong winds, with
OL,17,Fthe risk of coastal gales in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
